Block X: cached-only D1s programs for mem0_rep, server context as a lower bound, driver end-to-end test

The program view sends only response-cache hits of the D1s cells: the run checks every program
request it will send before any model call and stops otherwise. The prefix check compares model,
revision, engine image and engine arguments exactly and requires at least E5's context length.
An end-to-end test runs one world through the driver and the analysis on a stand-in Memory.

